  (text "USB-C sink, 5.1k CC pull-downs (default USB power, no PD).\nVBUS load 0.75 A typ / 0.97 A max at 4.75 V: needs a 5 V >= 1.5 A USB-C supply.\nF601 0.05-0.11 R + FB601 0.045 R: VBUS 4.60-5.25 V at the converters.\nD+/D- (both orientations) -> U608 USBLC6-2SC6 -> USB_DP/DM (mcu_if)." (at 10.16 86.36 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 533298b6-f64a-5e9d-b86e-6bdda45dbc56))
  (label "USB_DP" (at 30.48 107.95 180) (fields_autoplaced) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify right bottom)) (uuid 9de2861b-febd-5493-8c31-f67581ea1963))
