  (label "-5V_LDO" (at 281.94 68.58 0) (fields_autoplaced) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid a83dfcfe-42af-5c01-a3f5-04d7ab1547f1))
  (text "U604 (asymmetric, SPEC 26): OUT+ = 1.2 V x 409k/100k = +4.908 V (4.760-5.056); OUT- = -1.22 V x 370k/100k\n= -4.514 V (4.381-4.647), 1 % dividers. BUF802 total >= 9.13 V (9-13 V). VIN 5.039-5.177 V (<= 5.5 V).\nOUT- headroom 0.181 V min (RNEG 4.5 R, 41 mA, 26 mV LDO); OUT+ in dropout by <= 37 mV at the worst corner.\nEN+/EN- = VIN, PGOOD to GND." (at 234.95 99.06 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 83e2bf47-145d-530c-ab6a-c39bffec0cb3))
  (no_connect (at 58.42 167.64) (uuid 9aa780cf-1a3b-535b-a6c5-c3c50925eb26))
  (no_connect (at 166.37 167.64) (uuid ab051188-6894-55fd-a186-ead72a53ba4e))
  (text "U601: VOUT = 0.6 V x (1 + 100k/22k) = 3.327 V (3.224-3.433 V with FB and 1 %).\n100 % mode dropout VIN >= 3.53 V at 0.67 A: margin >= 1.07 V at VBUS 4.60 V.\n0.19 W typ / 0.30 W max, +27 / +45 K. C631 Cff footprint DNP.\nU602: 0.6 V x 2 = 1.200 V; soft start 1 ms -> 1.2 mV/us (GW1NZ VCC 0.6-6 mV/us)." (at 19.05 190.5 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 5afd1904-a7d3-59a9-8108-02e333dbf6c1))
