  (text "U605: OUT+ = 1.2 V x 210k/100k = +2.520 V (2.456-2.584); OUT- = -1.22 V x 200k/100k = -2.440 V\n(2.380-2.500; 1 % dividers). VIN 3.24-3.37 V; headroom OUT+ 0.66 V, OUT- 0.45 V\n(RNEG at 3.3 V not in the DS, 5 R assumed). EN+/EN- = U603 PG (R617 to VIN)." (at 264.16 210.82 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 733bf47c-0eb8-508f-999a-37fd79830c57))
