  (text "Load (typ / max): +3V3 0.51 / 0.67 A, +1V2 20 / 30 mA, +5V1 0.29 / 0.34 A (GVA-84+ x2 + U604),\n+5V / -5V 37 / 41 mA, +2V5 40 / 48 mA, -2V5 42 / 50 mA. USB: 0.75 A typ, 0.97 A all maxima.\nEvery regulator: VIN range, dropout and margin in docs/research/power-tree.md section 3." (at 266.7 241.3 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 09eb5a2b-bf96-5104-99e3-5b5bef71d9d1))
